 "intro_zh": "肇庆星湖风景名胜区由七星岩和鼎湖山两大景区组成，主要景点有天溪十景、云溪十景、宝鼎园等，是全国第一批重点风景名胜区之一。景区特产花席、端州出产的端砚等驰名中外。",
 "intro_en": "Zhaoqing railway station (simplified Chinese: 肇庆站; traditional Chinese: 肇慶站) serves the city of Zhaoqing, Guangdong province, China. The station hosts train services to and from Guangzhou, Hong Kong, Kunming, Nanning, Hainan, and other parts of China. The station is an intermediate stop on the Guangzhou–Maoming railway and the western terminus of the higher-speed Guangzhou–Zhaoqing intercity railway.",
 "intro_en_source": "wikipedia",
